Hi,

Currently there is no developer working on xbox support. It's not that
we are against the idea, it's more that no one with an xbox is willing
to do the work. For example, I've added some NV2A support in the DRM,
but there are some other things we can't test (mostly, someone is
going to have to port the TV encoder programming code to nouveau).

Stephane
